// Title: Execute From Alternate Data Streams
// Rule ID: 7f43c430-5001-4f8b-aaa9-c3b88f18fa5c
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1564.004
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
